# Installed workflow files under .history/ are machine-local — except the
# shared API index. `/*` alone would ignore the `_shared/` directory
# itself, so git would never descend into it and the re-include in
# `_shared/.gitignore` (`!api-index.md`) would never fire. `!_shared/`
# keeps the directory visible; `_shared/.gitignore` then ignores
# everything in it except api-index.md, which is the one file under
# .history/ that must be committable (cross-machine sharing, eval 25).
/*
!_shared/
